        <label>storm shield</label>
        <description>A heavy ballistic shield carried by Terminators and Vanguard Veterans of the Adeptus Astartes. Beyond the ceramite and adamantium of its body, an integrated energy field generator crackles across its face, deflecting incoming blows and shots with violent force. \n\nThe Adeptus Custodes have also been known to bear storm shields, and smaller versions are carried by the Daemonhunters of the Ordo Malleus.</description>
