    <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
        <defName>BEWH_AstartesPrimarisShield</defName>
        <label>primaris shield</label>
        <description>A relic shield borne by Primaris Captains. Stronger still than a storm shield, it carries the bones of Imperial martyrs within its reliquary frame, a symbol of their sacrifice. \n\nThe practice was begun by the Imperial Regent, Roboute Guilliman, who wished for his newly-forged Primaris Marines to share a bond with the long and storied history of the Imperium.</description>
